.TH HD-CUPS 7 "October 2026" "hd-cups" "HyprDebian"
.SH NAME
hd-cups \- printing on HyprDebian
.SH DESCRIPTION
The package
.B hd-cups
installs
.BR cups ,
the print server.
Printers are set up through the web interface of CUPS, on
.UR http://localhost:631
.UE .
.PP
It conflicts with
.BR avahi-daemon ,
which
.B cups
recommends, and
.BR sane-utils ,
the scanner tools, so they are not installed with it.
Without
.BR avahi-daemon ,
printers on the network are not found by themselves; add them in the web
interface by their address.
.PP
To manage the printers, add your user to the group
.B lpadmin
and log in again:
.PP
.RS
.nf
sudo usermod \-a \-G lpadmin <user>
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cupsd (8),
.BR lpadmin (8),
.BR lp (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
